WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.650
Standing LP deliberately misses the downed Ryu.

2
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.050
Marisa Rushes into low pressure.

3
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.500
Ryu blocks crouching LK.

4
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:01.850
Marisa backs away and Ryu’s recorded throw misses.

5
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:03.250
Back HP punishes the throw recovery.

6
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.200
Heavy Dimachaerus and its follow-up launch Ryu.

7
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:04.850
Held back HP continues the corner juggle.

8
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.700
Light Phalanx ends the punish.
